<description>&lt;p&gt;Al-Shabaab militants seized a town in southern Somalia, claiming they killed 61 soldiers in a base attack, while Djibouti peacekeepers were killed in a clash with Hawadle militias at Beledweyne airport. The Somali president accused the United Arab Emirates of funding armed groups, leading Somalia to order the UAE ambassador to leave within 72 hours and recall its own envoy from Abu Dhabi, prompting the UAE to condemn the move. The United States conducted an airstrike on Al-Shabaab positions 40 km northwest of Kismayo and reversed a decision to halt funding for international military support. The conflict resulted in 2,284 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivwFBVV95cUxPdmF5V2FxNUNfQ1N4Z2RMRU1xYWYxUklnbjZEck5XQWlGRHhCTjdycFhVTExjSHFCVGhzdzlNTTFONUpKSFE5ZXdVdTBaX2R5OUdTME9fQ1AyWVpsaW9aLWxIcGg3SW9DRDlWVkw2QjFUbzF1ZEFmTjEzMmxka0NhUm15SGU4RVhJS1B4TFYxSTZqZGlUWVdFSHdaSDhhZVE2c2lzODRnTmktY3hnTVpHS2U4c2loNFhTb3BveVRYUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Somali Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwgFBVV95cUxNRVlZb21WekU5S2lTVWdKeWVNQmduSElhUnZkTExjcG5lNWVZVTVVcW5Qam1NWkFSSDhtQUpuVG5wQnZISWxvcEM0c2c1Q3YtX3pRZkZadlpBelBJVTd3S2tETFIzVUlpLWJHVi1HcThDT3YwSTVXaS1HXzU3SjFEWkFEWFhXSV9wYzN4UEYwbHZ4QURKVnlja0FzclJyeHhySUNFaW1jM3d6QThhZUZTVGNmUThSWnk4dWpCdUVLNXlTZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilwFBVV95cUxPT2FRa1pCeDZMbTZNUV9TRl9wdFl2OFRWZGhXQXZyYkVxYVNnYkl6US02bHNrUG9NYXRtZHFURUJvMld2aVA1LXlBQmNKd2pFeWx6NDZ2LUROY0w1RDVfQUZsOWo3bW9WaFdtSXl5WlFXQ2Zlc3lWWERGNW1wSGRhSkp2RGxPWDNJUTdKcHBVeGlCcDZ0X1Vn?oc=5&quot;&gt;FTL Somalia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Gulf News&lt;/a&gt;